Package: HellingerDistanceEnrichment
Title: Hellinger Distance Enrichment for Categorical Composition Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("GW", "McElfresh", email = "gw@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Paul", "Edlefsen", role = "aut",
           comment = "Original Hellinger enrichment methods")
    )
Description: Tests whether categorical compositions (e.g. cell-type or cluster
    frequencies per subject) differ between groups using Hellinger-distance
    enrichment ratios developed by Paul Edlefsen. Supports permutation and
    conjugate Dirichlet posterior-predictive Bayesian inference with Seurat,
    anndata, and long-table inputs.
